SUMMARY:Fall Launch Potluck
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we kick off a new season together at Saint James! After the 10:30 AM service\, we will gather for a potluck lunch to celebrate the start of our fall programs. \nWhether you bring a dish or just yourself\, we would love to have you there! \nClick here to let us know you’ll be attending and what dish you’ll be bringing. \nFeel free to drop off your dish in the church kitchen before the 10:30 AM service.
